        "id": "E9Q8Q6"
       }
      ],
      "value": "Co-localized with DISC1 at/around the centrosome. Localizes to the centrosome, at least in part, in a DISC1-dependent manner. Accumulates and oscillates at the dilation in cortical neurons during migration. CAMDI protein level is stabilized at the G1 phase and destabilized at the G2 /M phase"
     }
    ]
   },
